@MyProject_HostAddress = http://localhost:5280

### List all products
GET {{MyProject_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Create a product (201 Created)
# @name create
POST {{MyProject_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Keyboard", "price": 49.99 }

### Get the product just created (uses the id from the response above)
GET {{MyProject_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Upload an image for it (saved to uploads/ in Development)
POST {{MyProject_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Pretend this is an image.
--Boundary--

### Validation error (400): empty name, negative price
POST {{MyProject_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "price": -1 }

### Not found (404)
GET {{MyProject_HostAddress}}/api/products/999999

### Delete the product just created (204 No Content)
DELETE {{MyProject_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
